flowchart TD
    A[Voice Input] --> B[STT: Sarvam/ElevenLabs]
    B --> C[Transcript]
    C --> D[Chunking: Fixed-size/Semantic/Recursive/Metadata-aware/Sentence-window]
    D --> E[Embedding: SentenceTransformer]
    E --> F[Vector Store: FAISS]
    F --> G[Retrieval: Top-k chunks]
    G --> H[Optional: Reranking]
    H --> I[Guardrails: Safety/Topic/Grounding/Hallucination]
    I --> J[Generation: LLM]
    J --> K[Answer Output]
    style L fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    subgraph Observability
        L[Latency Logging: Each stage logs latency]
    end
    style Observability fill:#e6f7ff,stroke:#1890ff,stroke-width:1px